{"id":"stone-coral","name":{"en":"Stone Coral","ja":"石サンゴ","sc":"石珊瑚","tc":"石珊瑚"},"desc":{"en":"When the blue oceans turned into the Dusk Sea, this coral retained its shape, being swallowed up in the sands. It is often used by artists as a symbol of the Dusk World.","ja":"かつての青い海が黄昏の海へと姿を変えた際に、形を残したまま砂に呑み込まれ固まったサンゴ。黄昏の世界を象徴する存在として絵描きなどが求める"},"level":6,"slots":1,"evalue":15,"water":true,"earth":true,"effect":70,"kind":"Material","locations":[{"id":"green-desert","name":{"en":"Green Desert","ja":"緑の砂漠"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"},{"id":"sandy-shore","name":{"en":"Sandy Shore","ja":"砂底ヶ浜"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"}],"categories":[{"id":"animal","name":{"en":"(Animal)","ja":"（動物素材）"},"icon":"category-animal"},{"id":"antique","name":{"en":"(Antique)","ja":"（骨董品）"},"icon":"category-antique"},{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石）"},"icon":"category-ore"}],"index":66,"enum":"ITEM_MAT_STONE_CORAL"}